- 新增 run report：`docs/M3D_FULL_MECHANISM_VALIDATION_20260424.md`。另外清理 `/home/bzhang512/my_storage_1T/CV_Project/output/part3_BRPO/experiments` 下 95 个旧实验目录，释放约 `6.60 GiB`，manifest 记在 `~/.hermes_backups/cleanup_manifests/part3_brpo_my_storage_1T_experiments_cleanup_20260424_0828.txt`。

